so in this 4x game! There are 7 leaders in the game now: 1. King Arthur - England2. Joan of Arc - France3. Romulus - Rome4. Alexander the Great - Greece5. Gustavus Adolphus - Sweden6. Genghis Khan - Mongolia7. Cleopatra - EgyptI chose some leaders th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:31:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691809","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3760980-1846651706688839","game_id":"steam-3760980","kind":"announcement","title":"DeckTerra is Taking Part in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"DeckTerra in Steam Nest FestDeckTerra is taking part in October 2026 Steam Next Fest, and along with it comes a brand-new demo update! Stay tuned for the demo release Tomorrow October 19, 2026 at 10am Pacific More details to come... If you'd like to support the game, please make sure to Wishlist, it really helps me a lot. -Murray","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:00:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688839","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3760980-1844751498219338","game_id":"steam-3760980","kind":"announcement","title":"DeckTerra Gameplay Trailer Reveal!","summary":"DeckTerra has a new gameplay trailer! See the latest visual updates and gameplay changes in action in this brand-new trailer for DeckTerra, the historical 4X Deckbuilding game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T19:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219338","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3760980-1844115010489224","game_id":"steam-3760980","kind":"update","title":"DeckTerra Demo Update - 1.0.3","summary":"A brand new update is here for the DeckTerra Demo! Here's what's new: Expanded Tech TreeThis update adds 12 new Technologies to unlock, which unlocks a total of 8 buildings, 5 units, and a number of additional passive buffs and city construction actions. These new technologies serve two purposes:To add additional buildings and unlocks to the mid/late game of the demo (turns 30-50)To make a scientific victory more difficult to achieve. Updated Religion Buff TreesAlongside the prophecies update fr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T14:05:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489224","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3760980-1842846814447627","game_id":"steam-3760980","kind":"update","title":"DeckTerra Demo Update - 1.0.2","summary":"Thank you all for playing the demo thus far, here's what's changed in the 1.0.2 update: Mounted Units Get ready to charge into battle using the new Mounted Units! There are two new unit types available in the tech tree: The Mounted Axeman and the Mounted Swordsman.These units have exceptional mobility and modest combat strength, they're great for sieging far away cities. Religious PropheciesI got some feedback that the religious victory condition was feeling bland, so I talked to some playtester","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T19:32:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447627","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3760980-1842212951311581","game_id":"steam-3760980","kind":"update","title":"DeckTerra Demo Update - Version 1.0.1","summary":"Thank you for playing the demo :) Here's what's changed in update 1.0.1: Performance Improvements Sweeping performance improvements across the board. The game is benchmarking much better now, especially on AMD processors. The main menu lag is mostly fixed, and the in-game performance will be starkly different. I appreciate your patience if you had issues with this in the past. Quality of Life Changes- Added a recommendation system to the building project to point new players in the right directi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T22:27:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311581","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3760980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:36Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:35Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3760980":"2026-10-26T10:59:36Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3760980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:35Z"},"4636790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:36Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3760980","app_id":3760980,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"187553f71beecd6b4e81abaa692d91926760b179c6f6e2a9ae0dbdefbb4c8e48","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"DeckTerra는 카드를 중심으로 만들어진 4X 전략 게임입니다. 절차적으로 생성된 지